  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s25/c245c2ea> ;
  triage:notes "followup_pass AG.21-25: Pattern confirmed open on all branches from s21 onward. s18-s20 do not have these test helpers. s21: helpers active + 6 direct-match sites in harness.rs (lines 110, 161, 286, 409, 529, 686). s22-s23: same 6 sites but line numbers shifted to 111, 162, 287, 410, 530, 692 after merge-forwards. s24-s25: helpers still defined but unused (dead code); harness.rs pattern simplified to ResponseEnvelope::Send(outcome) form. Finding persists across s21-s25: duplication has not been consolidated. Both helper-pair locations remain active, creating maintenance/test-contract fragmentation. dispatchReady=true; highest_open_branch=s25; promote_to_branch=s25. Workspace sweep confirms pattern pervasiveness." .

